  {
   "item_id": "el-f4f848",
   "text": "I would like some soup for lunch."
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-8fcb35",
   "text": "Was the movie any good?"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-c3ad46",
   "text": "Where is my coat?"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-02c039",
   "text": "Shall I ask that man?"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-dae18d",
   "text": "Whats on TV?"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-bafe6d",
   "text": "dont feel sorry for me i am blessed for still being alive"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-2cfc44",
   "text": "I think you need a psychiatrist."
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-1d646d",
   "text": "Is she coming today?"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-121eff",
   "text": "That is the best thing that could happen!"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-b1bd0b",
   "text": "thanks for your care and love"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-c82c86",
   "text": "inform me again"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-b9e3ed",
   "text": "I think I'm getting sick."
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-df4945",
   "text": "I met with an accident so i cannot walk."
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-c1e506",
   "text": "Don't laugh at me."
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-f4a7f8",
   "text": "I think I can manage."
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-17fbae",
   "text": "can you please get me some food from the market when you go"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-725110",
   "text": "Don't stay out too late."
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-8eb7ae",
   "text": "Want to play a game?"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-0d546a",
   "text": "I'd like to be alone for a while."
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-5005bc",
   "text": "You sleepy too?"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-5f679b",
   "text": "Will you help me?"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-5618e6",
   "text": "Shall I take you to a parlour tomorrow?"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-b89373",
   "text": "i think he wont do it"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-342855",
   "text": "I am going to stay up for awhile yet"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-c6b6da",
   "text": "I'll fix it."
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-017784",
   "text": "Can we go outside please?"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-ed624e",
   "text": "the weather is getting real nice"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-be2d46",
   "text": "I'm waiting on a call from my lawyer."
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-d03211",
   "text": "I need to go to the library."
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-5574d1",
   "text": "i didnt knew that you would be such nice to me"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-ecf40d",
   "text": "This movie is generous."
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-62f634",
   "text": "I'm doing well, thank you."
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-e7c198",
   "text": "can you call your father to come?"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-1ea7b6",
   "text": "Can you let in some fresh air."
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-9baa05",
   "text": "milk no sugar"
  },
  {
   "item_id": "el-d6a6ca",
